"Pale Moon Lake City's Dragon Veins beneath the lake are completely destroyed."
"The lake formed when a cataclysm turned a vast mass of metal into water in an instant."
"The lake's center is a Qi and life desert over an ancient, deep ore-mine pit."
"The City Archives hold an incomplete siphoning formation scroll that was used years ago."
"The Emperor's agents watch who reads what in the Archives, seeking persons of interest."
"Later this year Huibai Yue, Lady of Pale Moon Lake, is born of Tianlan's fragment and prayer."
"Huibai Yue appears as a curly-haired woman with a moonlit fish tail and a fan."
"Tianlan charges Huibai Yue to guard the lake's Dragon Veins against the central Qi void."
